:"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple221/v4/35/7c/4f/357c4f90-6cec-272e-f242-435a0bee97fa/AppIcon-0-0-1x_U007emarketing-0-11-0-0-85-220.png/512x512bb.jpg","trackCensoredName":"EA SPORTS FC™ 27 Companion","averageUserRating":3.38436,"trackViewUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/no/app/ea-sports-fc-27-companion/id1127108818?uo=4","contentAdvisoryRating":"4+","genres":["Games","Sports"],"price":0.0,"bundleId":"com.ea.ios.fifaultimate","isVppDeviceBasedLicensingEnabled":true,"sellerName":"EA Swiss Sarl","releaseDate":"2016-09-22T11:36:58Z","primaryGenreName":"Games","primaryGenreId":6014,"trackId":1127108818,"trackName":"EA SPORTS FC™ 27 Companion","currentVersionReleaseDate":"2026-09-28T17:09:59Z","releaseNotes":"Welcome to EA SPORTS™ FC 27!\nWe’re continuing to make improvements including:\n\n- Added Simplified SBCs\n- Fixed other minor issues to improve quality and stability\n\n- The Companion Team","version":"27.1.0","wrapperType":"software","currency":"NOK","description":"This game includes optional in-game purchases of virtual currency that can be used to acquire virtual in-game items, including a random selection of virtual in-game items. \n\nThe Club is Yours with the official EA SPORTS™ FC Companion App.\n\nSQUAD BUILDING CHALLENGES\nNever miss an SBC with the Companion App. Exchange Player Items in your Club to earn new Players, Packs, or Customisation options.\n\nEVOLUTIONS\nCustomise players from your Club with Evolutions. Increase the stats of your favourite players and enhance Player Items with cosmetic Evolutions.\n\nGET REWARDED\nClaim rewards for your progress in Champions, Division Rivals, Squad Battles and Football Ultimate Team Events without having to log into your preferred platform.\n\nTRANSFER MARKET\nMake moves in the Transfer Market wherever you are. Exchange Players with the global Football Ultimate Team Community to build your dream squad.\n\nHOW TO GET STARTED\nTo connect your account, log in to EA SPORTS FC 27 on your preferred platform, and then:\n- Go to Ultimate Team mode and create your Football Ultimate Team Club\n- Create a Security Question and Answer on your preferred platform\n- Log in to your EA Account from the EA SPORTS FC 27 Companion App on your compatible mobile device\n\nRequires acceptance of EA’s User Agreement. EA’s Privacy & Cookie Policy applies. You consent to any personal data collected through your use of EA’s services being transferred to the United States, as further explained in the Privacy & Cookie Policy. Requires an Internet connection (network fees may apply). Requires EA SPORTS FC 27 (sold separately), an EA SPORTS FC 27 Ultimate Team Club on PC, PlayStation 5, PlayStation 4, Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One, Nintendo Switch or Nintendo Switch 2 and an EA account to play. Must be 13 or older to obtain an EA account. Contains direct links to the Internet and social networking sites intended for an audience over 13.\n\nThis game includes optional in-game purchases of virtual currency that can be used to acquire virtual in-game items, including a random selection of virtual in-game items. \n\nFC Points purchase is not available in Belgium.\n\nUser Agreement: terms.ea.com \nPrivacy and Cookie Policy: privacy.ea.com \nVisit help.ea.com for assistance or inquiries. \n\nEA may retire online features after 30 days’ notice posted on ea.com/service-updates.","sellerUrl":"http://www.ea.com/iphone","languageCodesISO2A":["AR","CS","DA","NL","EN","FR","DE","IT","JA","KO","NB","PL","PT","RU","ZH","ES","SV","ZH","TR"],"fileSizeBytes":"79427584","formattedPrice":"Free","trackContentRating":"4+","averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion":3.38436,"minimumOsVersion":"16.4","userRatingCountForCurrentVersion":4899,"genreIds":["6014","7016"],"artistId":284800461,"artistName":"Electronic Arts","userRatingCount":4899}